  "facts_of_case": "Appellant and respondent were married on 21.01.2016. A girl child was born out of the wedlock on 05.01.2018. The parties had continuous matrimonial discord, and the appellant left her matrimonial home on 09.08.2020. The respondent sought dissolution of marriage under Section 13(1)(i-a) of the Hindu Marriage Act, 1955.",
